plaintext
* SPICE Netlist

* Voltage Source
VCM 5 0 DC <VCM_Value>

* Transistors
Q1 4 5 1 NPN
Q2 5 4 1 NPN
Q3 0 2 3 NPN

* Resistors
RC 4 54 <RC_Value>
RC_delta 5 54 <RC_Delta_Value>
R1 3 0 <R1_Value>
Rout3 0 2 <Rout3_Value>

* DC Power Supply
VCC 54 0 DC <VCC_Value>

* Specify model for NPN transistor
.model NPN NPN (IS=<IS_Value> BF=<BF_Value> ... )